@Products.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### Listar productos
GET {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products?categoria=Electrónica&nombre=dell
Accept: application/json

### Crear producto
POST {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Notebook Dell XPS 15",
  "descripcion": "Laptop 15 pulgadas, 32GB RAM",
  "precio": 1500.00,
  "stock": 10,
  "categoria": "Electrónica"
}

### Producto inexistente
GET {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### Datos inválidos
POST {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "precio": 0,
  "stock": -1
}

### Health checks
GET {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/health
